      "text": "Activity 8"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 2640,
      "end_ms": 3920,
      "text": "Work in pairs"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 4880,
      "end_ms": 9320,
      "text": "Talk about your ways to celebrate a traditional festival."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 9880,
      "end_ms": 14160,
      "text": "Use the thinking map to organise your ideas."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 15120,
      "end_ms": 19140,
      "text": "Use the words and expressions from the reading passage"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 19720,
      "end_ms": 23040,
      "text": "and the useful expressions to help you."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 24220,
      "end_ms": 25860,
      "text": "Example conversation"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 27360,
      "end_ms": 31840,
      "text": "How do you usually celebrate the Mid-Autumn Festival?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 32900,
      "end_ms": 41660,
      "text": "I always spend the Mid-Autumn Festival with my family. We always have moon cakes. Sometimes"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 42300,
      "end_ms": 47020,
      "text": "we go for a walk to watch the moon. What about you?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 47020,
      "end_ms": 56000,
      "text": "We often have a family party after dinner. We sing, dance and play games together."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 57100,
      "end_ms": 58800,
      "text": "That sounds like fun!"
    }
  ],
